// paths); `isize`→`i64`; tuple-variant `Bar(isize)` kept; literals suffixed;
// `panic!()` arms → `return N`; single-field `Foo::Bar(..)` rest-pattern →
// `Foo::Bar(_)` (Logos does not parse `..` in a single-field tuple variant);
